{"id": "t050-028", "text": "Amara's cat Biscuit had emergency surgery tonight for a blocked bladder and has to stay at the vet overnight, maybe two nights. She's in bits, she's had him since uni. The bill is going to be enormous as well and she's only just started her new job at the library so money's tight. Message her tomorrow morning to see how he's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "emergency surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the library", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "money's tight", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message her", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-029", "text": "Phone call with Gustavo again. Dad's out of hospital as of Tuesday, staying with Gus and his partner for a few weeks while he gets back on his feet. Gus is sleeping on the sofa basically.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "as of Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he gets back on his feet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-030", "text": "I'm getting my eyes tested on the 4th and the boiler service is sometime next week, need to chase them for a slot", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eyes tested", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "boiler service", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chase them for a slot", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-031", "text": "Jada's op went ahead on the 14th, all good apparently. Remind me to ask her how the physio is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how the physio is going", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-032", "text": "Saskia confirmed — her birthday is June 21st. Dinner at that tapas place on the Saturday after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dinner at that tapas place", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-033", "text": "Caroline's husband is in for a heart procedure on December 3rd. She's putting a brave face on it but she's clearly worried. Their kids don't know yet. Should take her out for lunch before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "heart procedure", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for lunch", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-034", "text": "Imogen's out of hospital. Sore but cheerful, already complaining about hospital food and asking for proper coffee. She's off work till at least mid-May, possibly longer if the stitches play up. Her mum's come down from Edinburgh to stay for a fortnight. I'm going round on Sunday with magazines and the good biscuits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Sore", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cheerful", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "proper coffee", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "off work", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till at least mid-May"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Edinburgh", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t050-035", "text": "Ayesha's party is off actually, her grandad's unwell so they're doing a quiet family meal instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "unwell", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet family meal", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-036", "text": "Kwame starts his new job at the council after half term, the 3rd I think. He's a bit nervous about the commute, it's two trains and a bus, and his manager sounds intense. Chioma's chuffed for him though, he's been wanting out of the warehouse for ages. Don't forget to text him on his first day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the council", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "his first day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-037", "text": "Dr Fischer said Emre's mum needs a second biopsy, so it's dragging on into the new year. Emre is not coping great honestly, he's barely sleeping and his boss isn't being very understanding. I need to call him this week, properly, not just a text.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Fischer", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second biopsy", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "into the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping great", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-038", "text": "Pooja's leaving dinner is March 28. Her favourite thing is matcha anything. Caroline's collecting for a gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 28", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "matcha", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t050-039", "text": "Bethany's mum is having a hysterectomy in February, Beth's taking a week off to look after her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beth", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking a week off", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-040", "text": "Yosef said Nia was a total star at the hospital, eating ice cream the same afternoon. Bless.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same afternoon"}]}
{"id": "t050-041", "text": "Ellie wants a moka pot apparently, she keeps sending me links", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a moka pot", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-042", "text": "Jorge's sister is getting married 5/22 in Seville, the whole family's flying out the week before. He's best man and dreading the speech.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-043", "text": "Long chat with Dimitri. Wife's had some bleeding so she's on bed rest for now, scan on Friday to check everything's okay. He's trying to work from home as much as possible. Asked me not to mention it to the others yet. I should check in with him Friday evening after the scan.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dimitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bleeding", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on bed rest", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening after the scan", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-044", "text": "Connor wants to do a memorial walk for his dad sometime in the spring. Said he'd let me know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial walk", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t050-045", "text": "remember: bday card for Uncle Louis, his 70th is Jan 6", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bday card for Uncle Louis", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Louis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Jan 6", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t050-046", "text": "Joy's mother-in-law moves in with them at the end of the month. Joy's dreading it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves in with them", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-047", "text": "Kate's teeth done, face like a hamster lol. All fine. Off work till Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teeth done", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Monday"}]}
{"id": "t050-048", "text": "Chioma's been signed off with burnout for a month, from November 1st. Doesn't want visitors but said messages are fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off with burnout", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from November 1st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't want visitors", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-049", "text": "Amy and her partner bought a flat!! Get the keys sometime in the new year, January or February. Remind me to get them a housewarming plant.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bought a flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Get the keys", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January or February", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a housewarming plant", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-050", "text": "Pedro's MRI was clear, he's relieved. Back to football next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Back to football", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-051", "text": "Bought the present for Ellie already, the moka pot. Hidden in the wardrobe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t050-052", "text": "Dong's mum has a hip replacement scheduled for 17 January 2027 and Dong is flying back to Shanghai for a month to help out with her recovery. He leaves on the 10th. Text him before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Shanghai", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-053", "text": "Abigail's into sourdough now and wants a proper banneton for her birthday on Sept 2.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper banneton", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept 2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t050-054", "text": "Emily's brother Connor has his appendix out tonight, emergency. Emily's going to the hospital now. Don't know much more.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appendix out", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t050-055", "text": "Must sort the gym cancellation before the next payment, and book flu jab", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the gym cancellation", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the next payment", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book flu jab", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t050-056", "text": "Laila said the baby's got a check-up at six weeks, around Dec 9. Ahmed's going back to work after that.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "check-up", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around Dec 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after that", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-057", "text": "Jen texted back, she's going back to work part time from next month, three days a week to start with. Says she's tired but getting there, still can't lift anything heavy. She's got really into audiobooks while recovering, mostly long fantasy series, she's halfway through the Wheel of Time. Might get her an Audible credit or two, her birthday's sometime in the autumn anyway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work part time", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "three days a week", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "getting there", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't lift anything heavy", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "audiobooks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while recovering"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "long fantasy series", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wheel of Time", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the autumn", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-058", "text": "Gustavo's birthday soon, early December-ish? He's been saying he needs a decent pair of walking boots. Could split it with his partner. Ask Gus's partner what size he takes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early December-ish", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "needs a decent pair of walking boots", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Gus's partner what size he takes", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-059", "text": "Nia (Yosef's eldest) has her ballet show on April 12, she's got a solo. Very nervous apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet show", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-060", "text": "Felt like a good day. Nothing much to note.", "spans": []}
